WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.350
The Canadian parallel — Peter Nygard.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.150
Canada produced its own Epstein.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:13.462
Fashion mogul Peter Nygard was convicted on sexual assault charges involving dozens of victims across decades.

00:00:13.462 --> 00:00:23.062
He used wealth, corporate infrastructure, and political connections to traffic and assault young women across Canada, the Bahamas, and the United States.
